		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Black, roiling puddle of ooze, bulging with faces, arms, elbows, toes, and a multitude of other parts.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 8, <strong>HP</strong> 52, <strong>ATK</strong> 4 bite +8 (1d8) and cacophony, <strong>MV</strong> near (climb, swim), <strong>S</strong> +2, <strong>D</strong> -2, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> -3, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> -3, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 11</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Cacophony</strong>. Creatures within near, WIS 12+ or 1d4 WIS damage. Immune for 1 day if passed check.</p><p></p><p><strong>Engulf</strong>. STR 12+ or trapped inside shoggoth. Touch attack autohits engulfed targets each round. STR 12+ on turn to escape.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
